<!--
  PLACEHOLDER — not a real Firebase iOS config.

  Download the real GoogleService-Info.plist from Firebase Console:
    Project lawncare-72560 → Project Settings → Your apps → iOS app
    (bundle ID: com.collins.lawncare)

  Or run on your Mac after firebase login:
    npm run firebase:keys lawncare-72560

  Save the downloaded file as:
    ios/App/App/GoogleService-Info.plist

  Then add the Firebase iOS SDK via Swift Package Manager and call
  FirebaseApp.configure() in AppDelegate.swift (see docs/IOS_FIREBASE.md).
-->
